{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1000_201xxx", "source_sha256": "55ed330c27f3d59de72aff0a4663be731c054cd1f2e5b400f6e8e1f99944ccbb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1c479b218e5d6b2a2d42e18dabee5d493fd0dd0246bea1ed99e4379ccfcced79", "ja": "あれ、詩花じゃないか。\n今日も来てくれてたんだ？", "zh": "哎呀，这不是诗花吗？\n你今天也来啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1002_201xxx", "source_sha256": "effd8b24bfe95d56fc40ebf5f1a4e0a62de0a23ba9ef591b537696e2121dfcea", "ja": "はい、昴ちゃんに招待してもらって。\n今日もとっても楽しくて、感動的なステージでした！", "zh": "嗯，是小昴邀请我来的。\n今天的表演真是有趣，让我非常感动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1003_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2c39c81fc20bbb4e0034b73925ca900ceee350f1ae2268169a9f666cae424065", "ja": "感動して……困ってしまうくらい。ふふっ。", "zh": "感动到……都有点伤脑筋了，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0f9ddd6c3a3f6c4380041b055a8ebbf9ae9bfdd153e2db8f9dcac73a88ebf0ea", "ja": "ん？　困るっていうのは、どうして？", "zh": "嗯？为什么会伤脑筋？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1005_201xxx", "source_sha256": "151c4d7e14c8b106c3b4be8aa1896680d8fad6532d2261ed485ffe66ac6dc184", "ja": "……。実は私、ずっと探しているんです。私にとっての\n理想のアイドルって、どんなのだろうって。", "zh": "……其实我一直在追寻，\n对我而言什么才是理想中的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1006_p", "source_sha256": "21db2d3ea00035e64f55b26ab2ca2d207dc39f45e9f0bd87debf3c86f7025f91", "ja": "理想のアイドルか。\nつまり目標みたいなものかな？", "zh": "理想中的偶像呀……\n换句话说，就是目标之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1007_201xxx", "source_sha256": "360c34291c7f03fcc79a9ead3f2624048b17283e65664e1b3cc5b259840514a2", "ja": "はい。うちの社長は、王者として頂点に君臨しろ、\n他のアイドルを圧倒しろ、なんて言いますけど。", "zh": "嗯。我们的社长，总是嚷嚷着要\n「以王者之姿君临天下」、「凌驾其他偶像」之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1008_201xxx", "source_sha256": "adca8711f5b89720943780af1047ef1bf1d8013454557d3e0779cd580d71b1a1", "ja": "でも……私は、\nそれはちょっと違う気がしていて。", "zh": "可是我……\n认为这不是自己要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1009_201xxx", "source_sha256": "8ea1f264acb4654d964ee09a2007f68f89bfbad500126f17e2167993bb337913", "ja": "ずっと私が憧れていたアイドルのイメージは、\nもっと近くに感じられる人なのかな、って。", "zh": "我觉得自己一直以来憧憬的偶像，\n应该给人一种平易近人的印象才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1010_p", "source_sha256": "65e7d750dd2383b202bf3f1f6ad0cf17ee1b90d1ff89bacfe51e801eca51e0f7", "ja": "確かに……君の存在感やオーラには圧倒されるけど、\n決して近寄りがたいわけじゃない。", "zh": "的确……你的存在感和气场虽然惊人，\n但绝对不会让人想敬而远之。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c1b9fa722f1e6d7cba00cc7d1395456c2c698194782aebbea95a726c110ce525", "ja": "むしろ吸い寄せられるというか。\n……引力がある、っていう気がするよ。", "zh": "反倒让人更为你着迷……\n我想是有一种引力在的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1012_201xxx", "source_sha256": "1151ce8f666ad0b6ee389d192b21de374913d17e430435677ec6419471a504bc", "ja": "あっ、そうです、引力！　私の憧れのイメージも、\nそういう感じで……もっとみんなに近づきたいんです！", "zh": "啊，就是引力！我憧憬的感觉也是像这样……\n我想更贴近台下的观众！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1013_201xxx", "source_sha256": "9cab912ad46eb039a56abdb74dbd73fd14a1793e7ca2c4ef8c6685c435ecffd6", "ja": "あの、それで……、あのっ！", "zh": "那个，所以……请问！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ea71a0b82aaa069941e229f4f9c720ee8d61c0a798473a759a9993e6c19df270", "ja": "うん？　どうかした？", "zh": "嗯？要问什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1015_201xxx", "source_sha256": "8e35fba5301cb09b3e1db8e3455280709b2f01859c30cae9d80c5dc0627f1f40", "ja": "はい。私、もうガマンできなくて……。\n思い切って、言っちゃいますね。", "zh": "嗯，我已经忍不住了……\n我就毫不顾忌地说出来啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1016_201xxx", "source_sha256": "4dc6979f0f317935b4ed6a0554d044abdaec16155617b6b4a2b3d20ca3b07aa0", "ja": "私を、765プロのみなさんと一緒に、この……\n劇場のステージに出してもらえませんか？", "zh": "可以让我和765艺能的大家一起，\n站上……这个剧场的舞台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1017_p", "source_sha256": "915279476257914974148d892d4aec1f1ace4fd077255ca36ed2645ba8a9e29e", "ja": "ん？　劇場のステージ……って、\nこの765プロライブ劇場の公演に！？", "zh": "嗯？你说剧场的舞台……\n你要参与765艺能演唱会剧场的公演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1018_201xxx", "source_sha256": "d77c4f2724620ab06920b59bfed5242da15212ea7dcc3c45a7d0c8f022010cfc", "ja": "はいっ。私の大好きな人たちと、一緒のステージに立た\nせてもらえたら……もっと見えてくる気がするんです。", "zh": "是的！要是能和喜欢的人们一起站上舞台……\n我觉得自己一定能看得更明确。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1019_201xxx", "source_sha256": "65f5f9dae95635e2ce7100cf58eff24acdde9035d05b679bae096d03d9f2b621", "ja": "私の理想……私の目標。\n私の憧れる、アイドルに繋がる道！", "zh": "找到通往我的理想……我的目标，\n那条成为憧憬中偶像的康庄大道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1020_p", "source_sha256": "69bcd615927b4a7435cf7300bdb8052efea0f61f9879a6a54e08309beedc589d", "ja": "な、なるほど……。確かに君のためにはなると思うし、\nうちの子たちにも、すごく刺激になると思う。", "zh": "原、原来如此……这样确实能帮到你，\n对我家偶像也是不小的刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7e03fb88251b7ce3ef9979106949c8a097b624feb0332bf9e44e3c3bb5a0ab03", "ja": "でも、君は961プロのアイドルだ。\nさすがに……どうかな？", "zh": "但你可是961艺能的偶像，\n再怎么说也……你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1022_201xxx", "source_sha256": "5cef1dcc958fd4dac89be3223433b3b32efba858c82058395e07dfb1052f9538", "ja": "あ、やっぱり……そうですよね、ごめんなさい！\nちょっと、言ってみただけ……です。", "zh": "啊，这么说……确实也对，对不起！\n我只是提提看……而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1023_201xxx", "source_sha256": "888bd5e483111f5787f9d357eb70011807f82fbd4354e9be85695e267b0df6d7", "ja": "うちの社長のこともあるし……。\nこれ以上甘えるのは、やっぱり……。", "zh": "还有我们社长的问题要解决……\n实在是不能再这样给你添麻烦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c56c42cbd616dcf20557afa8730db46a3954d3d55f77c49eeb81f9fbd49cf106", "ja": "いや、別に迷惑とかじゃないよ。\nただライバル事務所だっていうだけで……。", "zh": "哪里，倒也不是什么麻烦，\n单纯就是相互竞争的事务所而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b8f4da15ada57a9eab7defda477f38f9658c947fd6e51a8945f91ac9cf1f1442", "ja": "（そう、ライバル……。いや、待てよ？）", "zh": "（没错，竞争……咦？等等喔？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1026_president", "source_sha256": "e4dc9ac926d304c7bbed0be0c6293955e3bbacc9bf484ed3a2723258db720d3b", "ja": "うむ。39プロジェクトのアイドル諸君にとって、\n目標となるか、ライバルとなるか、あるいは……。", "zh": "嗯，她对39PROJECT的各位偶像来说，\n会成为目标还是劲敌，又或者是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1027_president", "source_sha256": "e08f749c1209e7a624a276efb408f0f14476bfe5f782b192ed8b86023f7ccc2f", "ja": "いや。いずれにせよ君たちにとって、\n良い出会いになることを祈っているよ！", "zh": "不，无论如何，\n希望与她的相遇能为你们带来正面影响！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1028_p", "source_sha256": "62be4d5ab8947155e17c596e9715ebd55b684cba0a8af7695f4fa6819155d06a", "ja": "（目標となるか、ライバルとなるか。\nあるいは……、か）", "zh": "（会成为目标还是劲敌，\n又或者是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1029_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6ecfc9dcd0c984d1b1b926f3bc7016510d9cf9d8a95a9b7e7df6ee1cf836512a", "ja": "あの……、\n{$P$}さん？", "zh": "那个……\n{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1030_p", "source_sha256": "aa30e12e75ac31a137184556394fb1955077482e782eaba41f3095c5b92f6846", "ja": "……よし、わかった。\n詩花、君のその申し出だけど……", "zh": "……好，我知道了。\n诗花，关于你提的请求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_1031", "source_sha256": "73797307db39096fced147262431ff2867765b459b1eeba84a870cdea1c467b3", "ja": "歓迎する", "zh": "欢迎", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2000_p", "source_sha256": "bbbc7d08a69e56ef1ce7e1707e80f487d00a5b03600656a6dbde78ddc9bed763", "ja": "歓迎するよ！\nこの765プロライブ劇場の、公演へようこそ！", "zh": "欢迎你！\n欢迎你一起参与765艺能演唱会剧场的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2001_201xxx", "source_sha256": "075612b586f11eb7c31000a2e316fed6aa4f1f66f093ff332861bd6a6ec27d15", "ja": "え？　……えええっ！？\n本当にいいんですか！？", "zh": "咦？……咦咦咦！？\n我真的可以去吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c4f3b500da2b5bcac7ab663d3f19db3a8d20ad34ff30d70128ba1516b7816a9c", "ja": "ああ。でも、君の事務所……というか、\n黒井社長の承諾は、やっぱり必要だと思うけど。", "zh": "嗯，不过还是需要征得你的事务所……\n应该说，征得黑井社长的同意才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2003_201xxx", "source_sha256": "8bd0f0bf744e5af74151891c43570925a8208fbf1131033118fdd071c9ef52b3", "ja": "うちの社長は……もちろん反対するに決まってます。\nでも、私が責任をもって説得します！", "zh": "我们的社长……肯定是反对的。\n不过，我会负起责任说服他！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2004_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6bced9d4f580614a312d37a530cc6840840939199ca1cebde15951d9e96526e4", "ja": "あ、安心してください。私、絶対に押し切ります。\n自信もありますから！", "zh": "啊，请放心，我绝对可以硬闯过关。\n我也有自信能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2005_p", "source_sha256": "3761aa506285364af341ad1aab44a7ce1c073ca8f63309a113fb4d12f0e213a4", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ？\nあの人相手にそこまで言いきれるとは……すごいな。", "zh": "这、这样啊，\n面对那个人居然能说得这么肯定……真是厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2006_201xxx", "source_sha256": "51816528eed04685981f3c78fce4164e9d9926ae2063e9d9a839faa45dccad0a", "ja": "それより、本当にいいんですね？　私、本当に\n劇場のステージに立たせてもらえるんですね！？", "zh": "不过，是真的可以吗？\n我真的可以站上剧场的舞台对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2007_p", "source_sha256": "f451ce182b145501d63da4d44baa748030b0dd33ba5229d77f358673e7b6a736", "ja": "ああ、約束するよ。\nもちろん、うちの社長の承諾も必要だけど……", "zh": "嗯，我答应你。\n虽然，这也得要我们社长同意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2008_p", "source_sha256": "a9160cce08522bf8137cd4a20ccc23dcbfb907a7f66f9859c4491d9c54941442", "ja": "きっと反対しないと思う。むしろ……\nアイドル達と一緒に、喜んでくれるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "但我想他一定不会反对，搞不好……\n他还会跟偶像们一起开心迎接你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2009_201xxx", "source_sha256": "4420952a230c88fc157bf863775c324b254e73c449a96200f94669ffa8d542a6", "ja": "ステキ！　夢みたい……。\n思い切って、お願いしてみてよかった♪", "zh": "太棒了！好像在做梦……\n有下定决心拜托看看真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2010_p", "source_sha256": "58247f48f5eb50c404a83bbb0ee0bd44a2211fdc9c3d899fa287e09c9f450863", "ja": "でも、君はあくまで961プロのアイドルだ。\n公演に出てもらう時は、ゲストってことになると思う。", "zh": "不过，你毕竟是961艺能的偶像，\n基本上还是会以来宾的身分让你参加公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2011_p", "source_sha256": "47d0842cf1e2629a6add9c0d913cbabb951514eb919d8b1ecac8d048eb532754", "ja": "それに俺も、君のプロデューサーになる\nわけじゃなくて、あくまでも……", "zh": "再说我也不会因此变成你的制作人，\n所以这部分还是要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2012_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c1e9f028e108b091c46d33187f4af86ac5bd6bf6e0270fa282fb36c7ffd3d4df", "ja": "わかってます。ひとりの観客、ですよね？　そして\n私にとっては、他の事務所のプロデューサーさん……。", "zh": "我明白的，要把你当一名观众，对吧？\n你对我而言，也只是其他事务所的制作人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2013_201xxx", "source_sha256": "3fb73c81bd4cee6034074d56a64d7f6742aa7acc039ce729c9ba1f59289360cd", "ja": "でも、いいんです。\n765プロのみんなとステージに立てるなら！", "zh": "不过，没关系的。\n只要能和765艺能的大家一同站上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2014_201xxx", "source_sha256": "1bf90f642773cfb4c73bb4830b33f5e413a2fe0cf834a634f5359d8f5970066c", "ja": "これからも、よろしくお願いしますね。\nこのステキな劇場の……ステキなプロデューサーさん♪", "zh": "今后也请多多指教啰，\n这个美妙剧场的……优秀制作人先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2015_p", "source_sha256": "ea9c9dddbce5ef03da44c9bdf9d551b0f7c35d31f6d41a664c3130140100c4ee", "ja": "（詩花がうちのアイドル達と一緒に、劇場の\nステージに……。とんでもないことになったな）", "zh": "（诗花将跟我们的偶像一起站上剧场的舞台……\n事情变得一发不可收拾了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0013_2016_p", "source_sha256": "df856ff2a559eae3f9aff285fe1357b48e3c14335c4492289be00f2366bec4a1", "ja": "（でも間違いなく、お互いの刺激になるはずだ。\n学ぶことも多い。どんどん切磋琢磨してもらおう！）", "zh": "（但这对彼此而言毫无疑问是良性刺激。\n大家要学的东西还很多，就让她们继续切磋琢磨吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
